\par\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 . Then comes stratagem to the fore. Learn to wheedle, to hint, to interrogate slyly, to blandly let the conversation drift\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93muster all wiles with blandished parleys, feminine assaults, tongue batteries\u8221\'94\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 in short, vulg. dict., to \u8220\'93pump\u8221\'94\hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 and work that pump with judgment, with craft, and with thoroughness. Moments of quickly repented expansiveness come to all mortals in country and in town, and in those rare moments of telling all they know, even reticent and secretive country people will give you many a china clue to follow. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0 Mandri searching in the dark corners for art in its natural habitat. In homes. A part of the family. Ambushed. The only he liked about art, being ambushed by something completely unexpected. And seeing as he needed to fuel his habit, he needed to make money, he should make it by peddling paintings, door to door, out in the countrysides where, under Hrkan sway, paintings have taken on the cause}
